 "notes": {
  "shelf": "Joe (2026-09-30): Sapporo and Anchor join the shelf and the bottles are rearranged, the beers first on the left: Bud Light, Sapporo, Anchor, Soonhari, then Bacardi, Grey Goose, E&J, Camarena, RumChata, Pink Whitney, New Amsterdam; Barefoot is removed. Every bottle is cut from the base through its measured matte, the wall and shelf behind all of them relaid row by row from the wall either side (the pendant cord onto New Amsterdam's old cap goes too), and the bottles pasted back evenly spaced, whole pixels moved, each dropped or raised with the shelf's slope. Sapporo and Anchor are the Bud Light longneck relabelled from their logo files: Sapporo's gold star over SAPPORO on black, its foil and cap gold; Anchor's navy anchor and wordmark on its yellow."
